class_name OrcGrunt
extends Enemy
## The basic orc: patrols, chases at twice its patrol speed and swings its axe in front of it
## after a clear wind-up (axe raised behind, warm flash, "!"). Standing in front during the
## swing hurts; stepping back or jumping over avoids it, and the follow-through is the opening.
## All behaviour is the Enemy default; this class exists for type checks and the scene.
